子，大家觉得手艺活真的稳吗？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1795479374, "replies": 51, "id": 1259114}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 74597, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9835, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 507063, "username": "zitup", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/zitup", "website": "https://ethanbuilds.app", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": " 创造挺得劲\r\n📝📌⌚️ LockSticky http://apps.apple.com/app/locksticky-lockscreen-watch/id6795869168\r\n🤳 http://slidefa.st", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_mini.png?m=1787802249", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_normal.png?m=1787802249", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_large.png?m=1787802249", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_xlarge.png?m=1787802249", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_xxlarge.png?m=1787802249", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0214/7aec/507063_xxxlarge.png?m=1787802249", "created": 1599480453, "last_modified": 1787802249, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "limhiaoing", "last_touched": 1795439486, "title": "看到很多人订阅 Gemini 很心动，问下一年 pro 量大管饱吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259033", "created": 1795400515, "deleted": 0, "content": "平常一直在使用 jio 的 pro，使用 3.8 flash，帮助我梳理产品哲学和视觉，还挺好用。\r\n\r\n现在看好多人订阅新模型，我对新模型的能力还比较有信心，主要想问下 5h/周使用量怎么样？和 GPT 相比如何？", "content_rendered": "<p>平常一直在使用 jio 的 pro，使用 3.8 flash，帮助我梳理产品哲学和视觉，还挺好用。</p>\n<p>现在看好多人订阅新模型，我对新模型的能力还比较有信心，主要想问下 5h/周使用量怎么样？和 GPT 相比如何？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1795400515, "replies": 47, "id": 1259033}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9a11/5815/52_large.png?m=1630576655", "name": "hardware", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9a11/5815/52_normal.png?m=1630576655", "title": "硬件", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/hardware", "topics": 6642, "footer": "", "header": "硬件发烧友的讨论节点", "title_alternative": "Hardware", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/9a11/5815/52_mini.png?m=1630576655", "stars": 2665, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 52, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 537477, "username": "csfreshman", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/csfreshman", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1615691429, "last_modified": 1749122721, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "kkocdko", "last_touched": 1795428551, "title": "朋友送了个拓竹 P1S，打了一下午，感觉没啥玩的了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259041", "created": 1795401641, "deleted": 0, "content": "有啥好玩的？\r\n\r\n实用的，能打印的？\r\n\r\n刚打了一下午，一个铲子，一个手枪，结果手枪子弹还卡住。\r\n\r\n经验就是不能打那种堆精度要求太高的？\r\n\r\n各位大佬有啥玩法？", "content_rendered": "有啥好玩的？<br /><br />实用的，能打印的？<br /><br />刚打了一下午，一个铲子，一个手枪，结果手枪子弹还卡住。<br /><br />经验就是不能打那种堆精度要求太高的？<br /><br />各位大佬有啥玩法？", "last_modified": 1795406712, "replies": 42, "id": 1259041}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "/static/img/node_default_large.png", "name": "bicycle", "avatar_normal": "/static/img/node_default_normal.png", "title": "自行车", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/bicycle", "topics": 67, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Bicycle", "avatar_mini": "/static/img/